{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67ea467c8900efe9c38af7","object":"chat.completion","created":1785195079,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to \"Be the null.\" The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nWhat is \"the null\"? Null is:\n- Nothing, absence, void\n- In programming: a value representing no value, absence of data\n- The empty set, zero, nothingness\n- Null is not even zero—it's the absence of a value entirely\n"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":224,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}